  "id": "organizational-approach",
  "term": "organizational approach",
  "definition": "In this context, an organizational approach means understanding workers’ psychological health and safety by focusing on the organization itself, especially its policies, practices, and procedures. It takes a multilevel view of workplace conditions rather than explaining stress only through more limited traditional models.",
